(text "I_CHG = 890 / R_ISET = 890 / 1.78k = 500 mA\nI_IN(ILIM mode) = 1550 / R_ILIM = 1550 / 1.3k = 1.19 A\nEN2/EN1: 00=100mA  01=500mA (default via pulls)  10=ILIM  11=suspend\nFirmware selects ILIM only after CC1/CC2_SENSE confirms a 1.5A/3A Type-C source.\nTS = 10k fixed: 2-wire cell without NTC. TMR/ITERM open = default timers, 10% termination.\nThermal pad: via array to GND on L2." (at 30.48 111.76 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 5c119a34-e48c-4548-8fca-556da8a5e566))
(text "BATTERY INPUT + REVERSE POLARITY PROTECTION" (at 241.3 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid 327f1f5f-66db-4ab1-b808-094dc804c3c8))
(text "Correct polarity: body diode conducts, gate at GND turns FET fully on.\nReversed cell: FET stays off, charger protected. ~35 mV drop at 500 mA.\nSilkscreen + and - at J1: JST LiPo polarity is NOT standard between vendors." (at 241.3 96.52 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 3798f565-eb66-43cd-98c2-9998c7887814))
(text "3.3V RAIL  (TPS63802 BUCK-BOOST)" (at 30.48 147.32 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid 87b2b1f4-1038-46eb-9c32-715caa1aa08f))
(text "VOUT = 0.5V x (1 + 511k/91k) = 3.31 V\nMODE = GND: auto PFM/PWM, 11 uA Iq\nEN tied to VSYS. PG unused (open-drain, left open)." (at 30.48 213.36 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid a86dc9ff-f3da-4abd-b7ce-38e90755532f))
(text "SWITCHED BATTERY SENSE" (at 241.3 132.08 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid 9b691ffe-fa7c-4b7f-ab58-47942afa7926))
(text "VBAT_SENSE_EN high -> Q3 on -> Q2 on -> divider live.\nVBAT_ADC = VBAT / 2 (max 2.1 V), read on ADC1.\nDivider draws zero current when disabled." (at 241.3 198.12 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid f97521c0-a22a-43cf-ae09-48d990dfc385))
